- If the calculated start page is less than 1, it should be adjusted to 1, and the end page should be updated accordingly.
- The end page should be the current page plus the PAGINATION_OFFSET, unless the start page is 1, in which case it should be the current page plus the PAGINATION_OFFSET plus the difference between the start page and 1.

