```

For example, given the following tree structure:
```
tweet_replies = [
    {"id": 1, "children": [
        {"id": 2, "children": []},
        {"id": 3, "children": [
            {"id": 4, "children": []}
        ]}
    ]},
    {"id": 5, "children": [
        {"id": 6, "children": []}
    ]}
]
```
and a set of selected IDs: `{2, 4, 6}`, the filtered tree should be:
```
filtered_replies = [
    {"id": 1, "children": [
        {"id": 3, "children": [
            {"id": 4, "children": []}
        ]}
    ]},
    {"id": 5, "children": [
        {"id": 6, "children": []}
    ]}
]
