In this solution, the `encryptFile` function reads the content of the input file, encrypts it using the AES-256-CTR algorithm with the provided key, and then writes the encrypted content to the output file. The `decryptFile` function reads the content of the encrypted input file, decrypts it using the same key, and then writes the decrypted content to the output file. Error handling is also included to catch and log any potential errors during the file operations or encryption/decryption processes.

