The `GetTotalTimeMS` method simply returns the total time stored in `mTotalTimeMS`.

The `GetAverageTimeMS` method calculates and returns the average time in milliseconds. If there are no samples, it returns 0; otherwise, it divides the total time by the number of samples to obtain the average time.

