The `VertexBuffer` class represents a buffer of vertex data, and the `VertexBufferLayout` class defines the layout of the vertex data within the buffer. The `AddBuffer` function should associate the provided buffer with the layout and add it to the vertex array.

You need to implement the `AddBuffer` function within the `VertexArray` class. The function should take the following form:

```cpp
void VertexArray::AddBuffer(const VertexBuffer& buffer, const VertexBufferLayout& layout)
{
    // Your implementation here
